[Binary PNG file representing Rank-OLS fit plot]
This figure shows the Rank-OLS model fit for heteroplasmy burden vs age,
adjusted for sex, sequencing depth, and ancestry PCs.

X-axis: Age (years)
Y-axis: Heteroplasmy Burden
Points: Individual samples (colored by ancestry)
Line: Rank-OLS fitted line
Shaded area: 95% Confidence Interval

Key findings:
- Positive relationship between age and heteroplasmy burden
- Adjusted coefficient: 0.115 (p = 0.052)
- Model explains X% of variance in rank-transformed data
